  "title": "Agents, Workers AI, AI Gateway - createAI replaces workers-ai-provider and ai-gateway-provider",
  "content": "<p>The Agents SDK has a new <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/models/\"><code>createAI</code></a> function for the <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/models/ai-sdk/\">AI SDK</a> and <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/models/pi-ai/\">Pi AI</a>. It unifies what <code>workers-ai-provider</code> and <code>ai-gateway-provider</code> did: Workers AI models, AI Gateway catalog models, dynamic routes, and vendor models, through the <code>AI</code> binding or an account id and API token.</p>\n<p><code>workers-ai-provider</code> and <code>ai-gateway-provider</code> are now feature frozen and marked as deprecated. Please migrate at your convenience.</p>\n<figure class=\"nb-code-figure\"><pre class=\"astro-code astro-code-themes github-light github-dark nb-shiki-c6xiwz\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\">npm</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\"> i</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\"> agents</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<div><div class=\"class\"><div class=\"relative flex border-b border-border\"><span class=\"bg-primary pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-px h-0.5 rounded-t-sm transition-[left,width] duration-200 ease-out\"></span></div><div class=\"mt-3\"><div class=\"class\"><figure class=\"nb-code-figure\"><pre class=\"astro-code astro-code-themes github-light github-dark nb-shiki-c6xiwz\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">import</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> { createAI } </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">from</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\"> \"agents/models/ai-sdk\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">import</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> { streamText } </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">from</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\"> \"ai\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">export</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\"> default</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\tasync</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> fetch</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">(</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1jdh33\">request</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">, </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1jdh33\">env</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\t\tconst</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-dzsirb\"> ai</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\"> =</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> createAI</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">({ binding: env.</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-dzsirb\">AI</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">, id: </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"my-gateway\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\t\tconst</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-dzsirb\"> result</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\"> =</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> streamText</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\tmodel: </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\">ai</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">(</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"anthropic/claude-opus-5.5\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\t\tfallback: [</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"@cf/zai-org/glm-4.7-flash\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\t}),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\tprompt: </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"Write a haiku about Durable Objects\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\t\treturn</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> result.</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\">toTextStreamResponse</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">};</span></span></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"class\"><figure class=\"nb-code-figure\"><pre class=\"astro-code astro-code-themes github-light github-dark nb-shiki-c6xiwz\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">import</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> { createAI } </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">from</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\"> \"agents/models/ai-sdk\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">import</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> { streamText } </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">from</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\"> \"ai\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">export</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\"> default</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\tasync</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> fetch</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">(</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1jdh33\">request</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">:</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> Request</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">, </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1jdh33\">env</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">:</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> Env</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\t\tconst</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-dzsirb\"> ai</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\"> =</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> createAI</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">({ binding: env.</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-dzsirb\">AI</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">, id: </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"my-gateway\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\t\tconst</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-dzsirb\"> result</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\"> =</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\"> streamText</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\tmodel: </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\">ai</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">(</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"anthropic/claude-opus-5.5\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\t\tfallback: [</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"@cf/zai-org/glm-4.7-flash\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\t}),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t\tprompt: </span><span class=\"nb-shiki-mdbnqw\">\"Write a haiku about Durable Objects\"</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t\t});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-1itgoe\">\t\treturn</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\"> result.</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-1t8gfj\">toTextStreamResponse</span><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">\t},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"nb-shiki-140thh\">};</span></span></code></pre></figure></div></div></div></div>\n<p>With <code>createAI</code> you get:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Every model by id.</strong> Workers AI <code>@cf/</code> ids, any model in the <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai/models/\">AI Gateway catalog</a>, and <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/features/dynamic-routing/\">dynamic routes</a> as <code>dynamic/&lt;route&gt;</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Vendor model objects.</strong> Pass a model from the vendor's own package, such as <code>ai(anthropic(\"claude-opus-5-5\"))</code>. It goes unchanged to AI Gateway's <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/usage/providers/\">provider-native endpoint</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>The binding, or an account id and API token.</strong> Use a gateway in another account, or call from outside a Worker.</li>\n<li><strong>Gateway options, fallback, and BYOK.</strong> Caching, logging, metadata, retries, <code>byokAlias</code>, <code>zdr</code>, and <code>vendorKey</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Stream resume.</strong> Through the binding, a catalog or dynamic route stream that drops mid-answer resumes.</li>\n<li><strong>Other model types.</strong> Embeddings, images, speech, transcription, and reranking in the AI SDK provider, and images in Pi AI.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Before</th>\n<th>After</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>createWorkersAI({ binding })</code></td>\n<td><code>createAI({ binding })</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>createWorkersAI({ accountId, apiKey })</code></td>\n<td><code>createAI({ accountId, apiToken })</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>createAiGateway(...)</code></td>\n<td><code>createAI(...)</code>, with <code>fallback</code> for a list of models</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>createAISearch</code> from <code>workers-ai-provider</code></td>\n<td><code>createAISearchNamespace</code> from <code>ai-search-provider</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>For AI Search, use <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-search/agent-sdks/ai-sdk/\"><code>ai-search-provider</code></a>. For more information, refer to <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/models/\">Models</a>.</p>",
